1. X3 Language 2-Page Spec (Concise)
Grammar Highlights:

X3 := Statement*
Statement := VarDecl | FuncDecl | ExprStmt | IfStmt | LoopStmt | ReturnStmt
VarDecl := 'let' Identifier '=' Expr ';'
FuncDecl := 'fn' Identifier '(' ParamList? ')' '{' Statement* '}'
ExprStmt := Expr ';'
IfStmt := 'if' '(' Expr ')' '{' Statement* '}' ('else' '{' Statement* '}')?
LoopStmt := 'for' '(' VarDecl Expr ';' Expr ')' '{' Statement* '}' |
            'while' '(' Expr ')' '{' Statement* '}'
ReturnStmt := 'return' Expr? ';'
Expr := Literal | Identifier | FuncCall | BinaryOp | UnaryOp | CrossVMCall
FuncCall := Identifier '(' ArgList? ')'
CrossVMCall := 'call_evm' '(' Expr ')' | 'call_svm' '(' Expr ')'
Literal := Integer | Boolean | Address | Bytes
First 20 Built-ins / Host Syscalls:

read_state(key:Bytes) -> Bytes

write_state(key:Bytes, value:Bytes)

emit_event(topic:Bytes, payload:Bytes)

call_evm(contract:Address, data:Bytes) -> Bytes

call_svm(contract:Address, data:Bytes) -> Bytes

gas() -> u128

current_block() -> u64

random(seed:u64) -> u64

hash256(data:Bytes) -> Bytes32

sign(data:Bytes, key:Bytes) -> Bytes

verify_signature(data:Bytes, sig:Bytes, key:Bytes) -> bool

sleep(ms:u64)

log(msg:Bytes)

revert(msg:Bytes)

transfer(to:Address, amount:u128)

get_balance(account:Address) -> u128

get_nonce(account:Address) -> u64

block_time() -> u64

emit_swap_event(pool:Bytes, amount:u128)

get_pool_liquidity(pool:Bytes) -> u128

Error Model:

OutOfGas

InvalidOpcode

StackOverflow

MemoryLimitExceeded

HostCallFailed

CrossVMCallFailed

InvalidReceipt

Annotations:

@pure → no state mutation

@view → read-only state access

@atomic → cross-VM atomicity enforced

@sandbox → enforce gas & memory bounds

